Enter the Chef Express world and discover the benefits dedicated to you!

With the new APP you can access all the exclusive services reserved for Chef Express customers from your smartphone.

To start, register and immediately access your personalized loyalty program.

Through our application you can:
- access your virtual card at any time and obtain discounts and promotions reserved for you;
- stay up to date on the status of your profile;
- access the Webcam Park service;
- request the invoice for each transaction;
- find the store closest to you, and be informed about opening hours and services;
- access dedicated promotions;
- access the Booking Groups service to book your group parking in comfort

Download the APP and discover the customized program dedicated to your needs!

Are you hungry? The showcase is nearby! Just log into the application, scan a QR code, choose the dish that you like and enjoy!
We really wanted to look into the future, and we succeeded, we confidently stepped into it, bringing joy to our customers! Queues, sellers and cash are in the past now!
A diverse range of goods, constant novelties, modern technologies aimed at preserving the nutritional value of products, healthy meals, affordable prices, a system of promotions, bonuses and pleasant discounts will definitely impress the customers. Technical support 24/7 is there to help you with any questions.

Our Blizko application offers:

- a quick registration;
- opening of Blizko micro-markets by scanning a QR code;
- an online catalogue of goods in the showcase;
- your purchase history;
- access to technical support from any screen;
- bonuses for the first registration and the first purchase.

Join us, it's cool with us!

Our team will be very happy to get a decent rating, and we will definitely reward the best review!
